摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness plugin: one-click ✨ polish for composer drafts — flash rewrite, auto fill-back · DeepSeek Harness 插件：输入框草稿一键 ✨ 润色，flash 改写、自动回填","id":"gh:1333832178","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-composer-polish","slug":"tianji-qingtian/dsh-composer-polish","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness plugin: one-click ✨ polish for composer drafts — flash rewrite, auto fill-back · De"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"epSeek Harness 插件：输入框草稿一键 ✨ 润色，flash 改写、自动回填"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-composer-polish"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"One-click draft polisher for the DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`) composer. Type a rambling draft, hit the *"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"*✨ 润色 / Polish** button in the input tool row, and a few seconds later the polished text replaces th"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"e draft in the input box — you preview, maybe edit, then send. No scoring, no evaluations: draft in "},{"id":"p3s4","text":"t box — you preview, maybe edit, then send. No scoring, no evaluations: draft in → better draft out."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> The harness is in developer preview and iterates quickly — expect compatibility-breaking changes."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> 中文说明见 README.zh.md。"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **✨ button in the tool row** — sits in `conversation.input.right`, the official seat for clickable"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" controls beside the send button. Disabled while the draft is empty or pure whitespace, shows a spin"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ner while polishing, and never lets double-clicks fire a second request.\n- **Zero-prefix flash rewri"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"te** — the host half rewrites the draft with a single `deepseek-v4-flash` stream (`reasoningEffort: "},{"id":"p7s5","text":"'off'`, ~2000 token cap). The main model never runs and its prefix cache is never touched. If the pi"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"nned model id is missing from the provider catalog, it retries once with a flash-class model discove"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"red via `llm.listModels`.\n- **Fill-back, not chat** — the polished text goes straight into the input"},{"id":"p7s8","text":" box through `inputActions.setDraft`, the official public draft write path. You can edit it again or"},{"id":"p7s9","text":" polish a second time; nothing is sent until you press send. Image attachments are never touched — o"},{"id":"p7s10","text":"nly the text is replaced.\n- **Fails silent** — a failed or empty rewrite leaves the draft untouched "},{"id":"p7s11","text":"(console log only, no toasts).\n- **Privacy** — the `/polish` command registers with `recordInput: fa"},{"id":"p7s12","text":"lse`, so the raw draft never lands in the session log; only the polished result is recorded in `comm"},{"id":"p7s13","text":"and/done`.\n- **No custom wire protocol** — Client→Host rides the harness's built-in `commands` remot"},{"id":"p7s14","text":"e (the same channel the shipped `/` commands use).\n- **i18n zh/en** — button label and tooltip follo"},{"id":"p7s15","text":"w the harness `locale` service.\n- **Language and voice follow the draft** — the rewrite answers in t"},{"id":"p7s16","text":"he draft's language and keeps the user's voice (it strips filler but won't turn the text more formal"},{"id":"p7s17","text":", salesy, or robotic); code blocks, file paths, command lines, identifiers, and technical terms stay"},{"id":"p7s18","text":"or robotic); code blocks, file paths, command lines, identifiers, and technical terms stay verbatim."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### Prerequisites"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The `dsh` CLI must be on your `PATH`. If you only ever ran the harness through `npx`, `dsh` is not i"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"nstalled and you will get `zsh: command not found: dsh` — install it globally first. This release ta"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"rgets harness `0.2.0-rc.1` (for an older harness use tag `v0.1.5`):"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"`pnpm add -g @deepseek-ai/dsh` also works if your pnpm global bin dir is on `PATH` (otherwise pnpm a"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"sks you to run `pnpm setup` first). Alternatively skip the global install and prefix the commands be"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"low with `npx @deepseek-ai/dsh …`."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Piece | Mechanism |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Button seat | `conversation.input.right` list slot (session scope); the standard kit's selector ho"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"ok `useInput((s) => s)` reads the draft, `inputActions.setDraft()` writes it back |\n| Client → Host "},{"id":"p14s3","text":"| built-in `commands` remote, hard-injected (`inject: ['remote', 'remote.commands']`): `ctx.remote.c"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"ommands.execute(sessionId, '/polish ' + draft)` — the same roundtrip the shipped slash commands use;"},{"id":"p14s5","text":" no custom RPC |\n| Host rewrite | `/polish` command handler → zero-prefix `ctx.llm.stream` on `deeps"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"eek-official` / `deepseek-v4-flash` (`reasoningEffort: 'off'`, `maxTokens` 2000), one-shot, with a o"},{"id":"p14s7","text":"ne-time catalog fallback when the pinned model id is unavailable |\n| Result channel | handler return"},{"id":"p14s8","text":"s `{ kind: 'success', text }`; the client reads it from `CommandExecution.result.text` and fills it "},{"id":"p14s9","text":"back via `setDraft` |\n| Privacy | `recordInput: false` → `command/run` omits `args`, so the raw draf"},{"id":"p14s10","text":"t is never written to the session log |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Behavior spec (from REQUIREMENTS.md)"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| # | Scenario | Behavior |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| 1 | Non-empty draft, click ✨ | read draft → flash rewrite → fill back |\n| 2 | Empty / whitespace-o"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"nly draft | button disabled |\n| 3 | Rewrite fails / returns empty | draft untouched, console log onl"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"y, no toast |\n| 4 | Rewrite in flight | button shows spinner, repeat clicks blocked |\n| 5 | Draft ha"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"s image attachments | only the text is polished; images untouched |\n| 6 | Chinese / English draft | "},{"id":"p17s5","text":"rewritten in the draft's language |\n| 7 | Code blocks / lists / technical terms | structure kept, co"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"de verbatim, no accuracy changes |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Harness compatibility"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Built and verified against harness `0.2.0-rc.1`."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The harness checks a plugin's `@deepseek-ai/dsh*` `peerDependencies` ranges both when\nthe package is"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" installed and when a profile starts. A plugin whose declared range does\nnot cover the running `dsh "},{"id":"p20s3","text":"--version` is refused or skipped (`skipping profile bundle\n\"dsh-composer-polish\": Plugin dsh-compose"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"r-polish@… is incompatible with dsh …`), which\nis why an outdated plugin simply disappears from the "},{"id":"p20s5","text":"composer after a harness upgrade.\nv0.1.6 widens the ranges to `^0.2.0-rc.1`; the host code itself ne"},{"id":"p20s6","text":"eded no change —\n`commands.register` (with `recordInput`), `llm.stream`, and the client-side\n`useInp"},{"id":"p20s7","text":"ut` selector + `inputActions.setDraft` + `remote.commands.execute(sessionId,\nline, [])` are unchange"},{"id":"p20s8","text":"d in 0.2.0. For the `0.1.x` harness line use tag `v0.1.5`."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Known limitations"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- The fill-back is skipped when the draft changed during the rewrite (stale-edit guard) — by design,"},{"id":"p22s2","text":" your newer edits always win.\n- Drafts over 50 KB are truncated before the rewrite (a draft of that "},{"id":"p22s3","text":"size is beyond what a single flash call can meaningfully restructure anyway).\n- The polished result "},{"id":"p22s4","text":"is recorded in `command/done` (the commands channel's own lifecycle log); only the *original* draft "},{"id":"p22s5","text":"is kept out of the log via `recordInput: false`.\n- `deepseek-v4-flash` is pinned as the rewrite mode"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"l; if the harness renames model ids, the catalog fallback picks a flash-class replacement and logs a"},{"id":"p22s7","text":"the harness renames model ids, the catalog fallback picks a flash-class replacement and logs a line."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
